# Context

## Background
This commit integrates the work produced by the Looper run
(session run-58f364dd4667b5a2) on the development machine.
Workers completed 49 of 58 backlog tasks; the working tree was
committed as a whole after the final product review passed.

## Why This Way
The Looper controller keeps its own refs (refs/looper/*), but
master had not received the integrated result. A single squash
style commit captures the reviewed state; per-task history
remains in the Looper runtime and its review logs.

## Verification
Final review on 15 October 2026 ran 116 local checks; 115
passed. The one failure is expected: the installed-binary MCP
check requires a release binary, and none was built yet.

